text:
This looks like diced chicken breast (or possibly tofu) over sliced red onion and shredded carrot in a bowl. I estimate about 150 g of chicken, 30 g of onion and 10 g of carrot, roughly 190 g in total.

Grilled chicken breast is about 165 kcal per 100 g, so 150 g gives about 248 kcal. The onion adds about 12 kcal and the carrot about 4 kcal. That totals roughly 264 kcal, which I rounded to 260.

